{number: 15}
{title: Praise Him! Praise Him!}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[D] deemer!
[G] Sing, O Earth, His wonderful [D] love pro-[G] claim!
[G] Hail Him! hail Him! highest archangels in [D] glory;
[G] Strength and honor [A7] give to His holy [D] Name!
Like a [D7] shepherd, Jesus will guard His [G] children,
In His [Em] arms He [A7] carries them all day [D] long: [D7]
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [C] greatness;
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! [D7] ever in joyful [G] song!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[D] deemer!
[G] For our sins He suffered, and [D] bled, and [G] died;
[G] He our Rock, our hope of eternal sal-[D] vation,
[G] Hail Him! hail Him! [A7] Jesus the Cruci-[D] fied.
Sound His [D7] Praises! Jesus who bore our [G] sorrows,
Love un-[Em] bounded, [A7] wonderful, deep and [D] strong: [D7]
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [C] greatness;
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! [D7] ever in joyful [G] song!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[D] deemer!
[G] Heav'nly portals loud with ho-[D] sannas [G] ring!
[G] Jesus, Savior, reigneth forever and [D] ever;
[G] Crown Him! crown Him! [A7] Prophet, and Priest, and [D] King!
Christ is [D7] coming! over the world vic-[G] torious,
Pow'r and [Em] glory [A7] unto the Lord be-[D] long: [D7]
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [C] greatness;
[G] Praise Him! praise Him! [D7] ever in joyful [G] song!
